      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Nimble Dodge",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger The ambush observer is targeted with a melee or ranged attack by an attacker it can see\n\n---\n\nEffect The ambush observer gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.",
      "rules": [
